This repository contains only code written by the authors of CureWM.

It is designed to be used alongside several third-party projects, none of which
are redistributed here. Obtain each from its own source, under its own license:

  Cosmos-Policy / Cosmos-Predict  (NVIDIA).  The world model that is post-trained.
      The upstream experiment config carries an NVIDIA proprietary notice, so
      cluster/experiment_config_additions.py distributes only the block we append
      to it, with instructions for applying it. No upstream file is included.
  Ctrl-World.  The video world model used on hardware.
  LIBERO.  Simulator and demonstration suites.
  RoboCasa.  Simulator and demonstration suites.
  ManiSkill3.  Simulator used by the early engine work.
  DROID.  Robot control stack for the Franka arm.

Model weights and datasets are likewise not redistributed. See README.md for what
needs to be downloaded and from where.
